  "subject": "The auntie who records sound-truck slogans behind a Huwei stationery shop voices all five rival council candidates (numbers only, no real parties), so in the final week her own voice out-shouts itself at the roundabout, and she still won't tell her husband her vote.",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien samba-pagode, bright Rio backyard pagode groove. Cavaquinho playing syncopated off-beat chord chops; pandeiro with a rolling sixteenth-note pattern and thumb slaps; tanta hand drum and surdo holding a soft low pulse with the accent on beat two; seven-string nylon guitar walking bass counter-lines; cuica squeaking laughing answers between vocal lines. Warm live-room mix, close percussion, dry brassy vocal. Female mezzo, bright brassy chest voice with a grin, clearly sung melody, one lead voice. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 100 BPM, G major. Cheeky, proud, sunny street-corner party. No rap, no trap hi-hats, no autotune, no synth bass, no EDM drop.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n文具店後壁 一支麥克風\n一號先生 聲愛粗粗\n二號小姐 聲愛幼幼\n三號阿伯 愛咳兩聲\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n四號五號 閣來換喙\n攏是阮一个 咧變\n\n[Chorus]\n五台車 一个聲\n踅圓環仔 相喝輸贏\n逐家聽著 攏是我\n我投啥人 我袂講\n\n[Verse]\n圓環仔頂 五台車相拄\n一號罵二號 講好好咧\n喇叭仔內 攏是阮的喉\n喝甲破聲 閣愛喝落去\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n阮翁坐佇店裡 食茶\n笑笑仔問 你投啥人\n\n[Chorus]\n五台車 一个聲\n踅圓環仔 喝甲冒煙\n逐家聽著 攏是我\n問我投啥人 我笑咧\n\n[Verse]\n上尾禮拜 喉嚨變沙\n家己共家己 吵甲面紅\n三號的聲 閣拍斷四號\n我家己 嘛袂記得是啥人\n\n[Bridge]\n票箱頭前 無人知\n我的手 畫佇佗一格\n\n[Chorus]\n五台車 一个聲\n踅圓環仔 喝甲收尾\n逐家聽著 攏是我\n阮翁問我 我閣笑咧\n\n[Outro]\n五台車 一个聲\n我的票 我家己知",
